   \\(2 + 1 + 1\\) (carried over) \\(= 4\\).\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:.\n\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '485613'}  6%|6         | 30/500 [02:00<20:30,  2.62s/it]
