\n   \\(4 + 1 = 5\\)  .\n   Write down **5**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 1 = 1\\)  .\n   Write down **1**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 5 = 5\\)  .\n   Write down **5**.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 7 = 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the hundred-thousands place.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 9 = 16\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**:  .\n   \\(16 + 1 = 17\\)  .\n   Write down **17**.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{0}730,018 \\\\.\n+\\,975,134 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n1,705,152 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '2705152'} 15%|#5        | 77/500 [05:01<26:20,  3.74s/it]
