 the thousands place.\n4. **Thousands place:** 4 + 5 = 9, plus the carried over 1 makes 10. I'll write down 0 and carry over 1 to the ten-thousands place.\n5. **Ten-thousands place:** 6 + 1 = 7, plus the carried over 1 makes 8. I'll write down 8.\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:** 3 + 9 = 12. I'll write down 12", 'cot0shot.math teacher_output_CoT': ".\n\n# Question:.\nWhat is the sum of 364,856 and 915,557?.\n\n# Reasoning:.\n\nLet's add the two numbers digit by digit.\n\n1. **Ones place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 7 = 13\\)  .\n   Write down **3** and carry over **1** to the tens place.\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 5 = 10\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(10 + 1 = 11\\)  .\n   Write down **1** and carry over **1** to the hundreds place.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 5 = 13\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(13 + 1 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **4** and carry over **1** to the thousands place.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(4 + 5 = 9\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(9 + 1 = 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the ten-thousands place.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 1 = 7\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(7 + 1 = 8\\)  .\n   Write down **8**.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(3 + 9 = 12\\)  .\n   Write down **12**.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{0}364,856 \\\\.\n+\\,915,557 \\\\.\n\\hline", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1210413'} 33%|###3      | 167/500 [11:19<19:06,  3.44s/it]
