\(5 + 4 + 1\\) (carried over) \\(= 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1** to the next place.\n\n7. **Millions place:**  .\n   The carried over **1**.\n\nPutting it all together, the sum is:.\n\n\\[", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1000874'}
