Write down **5** and carry over **1**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 1 + 1\\) (carried over) \\(= 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 4 + 1\\) (carried over) \\(= 7\\).\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 6 = 14\\).\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n```.\n    828,813.\n  + 641,693.\n  ----------", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1473506'} 72%|#######1  | 358/500 [22:47<11:15,  4.76s/it]
