**Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(6 + 3 = 9\\)  .\n   Write down **9**.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 6 = 14\\)  .\n   Write down **14**.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{0}863762 \\\\.\n+\\,635780 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n1499542 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1499549'} 73%|#######3  | 365/500 [23:13<08:17,  3.68s/it]
