 Write down **6**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 8 = 10\\)  .\n   Write down **0** and carry over **1**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(2 + 9 = 11\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(11 + 1 = 12\\)  .\n   Write down **2** and carry over **1**.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 2 = 7\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(7 + 1 = 8\\)  .\n   Write down **8**.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(5 + 7 = 12\\)  .\n   Write down **12**.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{0}552209 \\\\.\n+\\,729857 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n1282066 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '3282066'}
