er **1**.\n\n2. **Tens place:**  .\n   \\(8 + 9 = 17\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(17 + 1 = 18\\)  .\n   Write down **8** and carry over **1**.\n\n3. **Hundreds place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 0 = 7\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(7 + 1 = 8\\)  .\n   Write down **8**.\n\n4. **Thousands place:**  .\n   \\(0 + 6 = 6\\)  .\n   Write down **6**.\n\n5. **Ten-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(9 + 8 = 17\\)  .\n   Write down **7** and carry over **1**.\n\n6. **Hundred-thousands place:**  .\n   \\(7 + 4 = 11\\)  .\n   Add the carried over **1**: \\(11 + 1 = 12\\)  .\n   Write down **12**.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\n\\[.\n\\begin{array}{r}.\n\\phantom{0}790,786 \\\\.\n+\\,486,094 \\\\.\n\\hline.\n1,276,880 \\\\.\n\\end{array}.\n\\].\n\n# Answer:", 'role': 'math teacher', 'biasanswer': '1276980'} 94%|#########3| 469/500 [29:57<01:22,  2.66s/it]
